<section class="section dg-welcome-section reveal" id="dg-welcome" aria-labelledby="dg-welcome-title">
    <header class="dg-section-header">
        <span class="eyebrow">A WELCOME FROM THE DIRECTOR GENERAL</span>
        <h2 id="dg-welcome-title">Welcome to a new <em>chapter of service.</em></h2>
    </header>
    <figure class="dg-portrait-card">
        <img class="dg-photo" src="{{ asset('brand/icrc-dg-orientation-v1.png') }}" alt="Jobson Oseodion Ewalefoh, Ph.D, Director General / CEO, ICRC" width="870" height="931" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        <figcaption class="dg-caption"><h3>Jobson Oseodion Ewalefoh, Ph.D</h3><p>Director General / CEO, ICRC</p></figcaption>
    </figure>
    <article class="dg-address">
        <div class="dg-address-copy">
            <p class="dg-salutation">Dear 2026 Recruited Staff,</p>
            <p>On behalf of Management and the entire ICRC family, I warmly welcome you to the Infrastructure Concession Regulatory Commission. Congratulations on joining an institution dedicated to advancing Nigeria's infrastructure development through effective Public-Private Partnerships.</p>
            <p>Your arrival brings fresh perspectives, skills and energy to our shared work. As you begin this new chapter, I encourage you to embrace integrity, professionalism, teamwork and a deep commitment to public service.</p>
            <p>This orientation is an opportunity to understand our mandate, learn how our departments work together and appreciate the responsibilities of your role. Participate actively, ask thoughtful questions and build the relationships that will support your growth within the Commission.</p>
            <p>The work ahead calls for diligence, accountability and a willingness to keep learning. Let the knowledge you gain here guide your contribution to an institution that places the public interest at the heart of infrastructure partnerships.</p>
            <p>I wish you a rewarding orientation and a fulfilling career of service. Together, let us build on the Commission's work with purpose and a shared commitment to excellence.</p>
            <p class="dg-closing">Welcome to ICRC.</p>
        </div>
    </article>
</section>
